/*QUAKED worldspawn (0.5 0.5 0.5) ?
Editor container for level brushes. Not an NSD entity type.
This profile saves source .map files; NOD binary export is not implemented.
*/

/*QUAKED ghost (0.2 0.8 1.0) (-16 -16 -24) (16 16 40)
Player entity type observed in StarCraft Ghost NSD scene data.
The displayed bounds are an authoring aid, not verified engine collision bounds.

"origin" - Source position in editor Z-up coordinates.
"angles" - Source pitch, yaw and roll in degrees.

These source keys are an authoring convention. Conversion to NOD's left-handed
coordinates and NSD property tags must be implemented and tested by the compiler.
Placing this entity does not yet produce a playable spawn.
*/

/*QUAKED misc_model (0.6 0.8 0.4) (-8 -8 -8) (8 8 8)
Editor-only static decoration prop. This is not an NSD entity type.

"model" - VFS-relative NOD or NMB path, e.g. 3D/Models/example.nod.
"_frame" - Zero-based NMB model-entry index. NOD uses 0.
"origin" - Source position in editor Z-up coordinates.
"angles" - Source pitch, yaw and roll in degrees.
"modelscale" - Uniform scale (default 1).
"modelscale_vec" - Per-axis scale, overriding modelscale.
"_remap0" - Optional native material remap: textures/nod/old;textures/nod/new.

Models use source coordinates, native UVs and LOD 0. Skinned meshes are shown
in rest pose; animation playback is not implemented. The original asset tree
is read-only. Map saving preserves references, not copies of model geometry.
Binary NOD/NSD export and coordinate conversion are not implemented.
*/
